# The control plane image's context: the Go module and the web console's
# source, and nothing else. Docker
# finds this file beside the Containerfile; podman is handed it with
# --ignorefile (`make cp-image`). data/ (the Bots' workspaces), silo.yaml
# (keys), bin/, ios/, node_modules and .git never reach the builder.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!gen
!internal
!cmd/silo
!web
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/e2e
web/test-results
web/playwright-report
web/.playwright
web/*.tsbuildinfo
internal/webui/dist
# A test run's leftovers and the tests themselves are not built.
internal/app/data
**/*_test.go
**/testdata
**/.DS_Store
